      "id": "ppj-exec-summary",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "PPJxNUNOX.ScanTrial\n\nDomain:\nFabric / Textiles Technique\n\nLifecycle:\nHardware Trial / Feasibility Assessment\n\nProgress:\nTBD\n\nGate:\nVendor Visit Proposed / Pending Leadership Approval\n\nOutcome:\nEvaluate NUNOX scanning and a Digital Library opportunity linking fabric, hanger, garment sample, visual and Technical metadata.\n\nTop Blocker:\nLeadership direction, schedule, objective, sample dataset and sponsor are not confirmed.\n\nNext Milestone:\nObtain leadership direction and confirm the 17-18 August schedule.\n\nLast Verified:\n2026-08-01",
      "x": 0,
