      "width": 760,
      "height": 560,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "ppj-management-attention",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "KEY MANAGEMENT ATTENTION\n\nTop Risks\n- Scanner workflow, storage, access, integration and commercial value are not validated.\n- Scope may overlap FD, CPD and Technical platforms if boundaries are not explicit.\n\nDecisions Needed\n- Approve or decline the vendor visit and Digital Library assessment.\n- Confirm leadership sponsor and business-case scope.\n\nExternal Dependencies\n- NUNOX Scan Trial -> Fabric Image Capture -> FD / CPD / Technical Integration Assessment -> Digital Library Business Case",
